<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (SnapSplit is a web-based application designed to perform semantic segmentation on images, enabling users to identify and isolate objects within a picture. By generating pixel-level classification masks, it helps computers understand the structure and contents of an image in detail. This technology is valuable for a variety of applications, including autonomous driving, medical imaging, object detection, and AI-powered image analysis.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
