<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The goal of this project is to build a machine learning model capable of automatically extracting the main subject from an image. For any given input picture, the model should output a new image in which only the subject is visible and everything else is rendered completely black. This subject isolation process can be used for automation in photography, digital art, augmented reality, virtual conferencing, and background replacement applications.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
