/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( Description: Automatically detect and extract the main subject from any image. The output will be an image where only the subject is displayed as in the original photo, while the rest of the pixels are set to black. This replicates the "cutout" functionality required in many media editing pipelines.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
