200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 437 0 R
/E (Preprocessing & Augmentation: Uploaded images are resized, normalized, and optionally augmented with flips, rotations, brightness/contrast adjustments, and stretching to prepare them for the model. Masks are generated for the target object class.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 438 0 R
